notes               = "Untitled in source. Four lines built on one inversion — سال‌های زندگی against زندگی سال‌ها. The English can reproduce it exactly, which is rare in this book. 12 Ordibehesht = 2 May 1991. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
draft               = true

===persian===

تو سال‌های زندگی را
می‌شماری...
من
زندگی سال‌ها را...
۱۳۷۰/۲/۱۲

===machine===

You count
the years of life...
I,
the life of the years...
1370/2/12

===lantern===

You count
the years of life.
I count
the life of the years.

1370/2/12

